WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.843
Amy looked in the mirror. She needed a haircut. Her bangs covered her eyes.

2
00:00:06.844 --> 00:00:10.470
Amy was going to meet her friends in one hour.

3
00:00:10.471 --> 00:00:13.591
They were going to watch a movie.

4
00:00:13.592 --> 00:00:18.104
The more Amy looked at her hair, the more she wanted to cut it.

5
00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:25.187
Then Amy got an idea. "I know what I'll do," Amy said aloud.

6
00:00:25.188 --> 00:00:32.343
"I'll cut it myself. After all how hard can it be?"

7
00:00:32.344 --> 00:00:36.435
First, Amy took some scissors out of the drawer.

8
00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:42.932
Next, she wet her hair. Then, Amy combed her bangs straight.

9
00:00:42.933 --> 00:00:49.258
She began to cut. Snip. Snip. Snip.

10
00:00:49.259 --> 00:00:55.450
Amy opened her right eye. It was looking good so far.

11
00:00:55.451 --> 00:01:03.681
Amy continued to cut the rest of her bangs. Snip. Snip. Snip.

12
00:01:03.682 --> 00:01:10.929
Amy stood back and looked at herself. She noticed a few strands weren't even.

13
00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:16.730
So she placed her left hand on her forehead and pushed the hair down.

14
00:01:16.731 --> 00:01:26.163
Snip. Snip. Snip. Amy let go of her left hand. Her bangs sprang up.

15
00:01:26.164 --> 00:01:34.418
"Argh!" Amy screamed. Amy's bangs were much higher than her eyebrows now.

16
00:01:34.419 --> 00:01:42.643
She looked quite ridiculous. Amy looked at her watch.

17
00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:45.764
She still had time to fix her hair.

18
00:01:45.765 --> 00:01:53.171
Amy squeezed some hair gel onto her hands. Then she put it on her hair.

19
00:01:53.172 --> 00:02:01.634
"Argh!" Amy screamed. Now her hair looked like it had been struck by lightning.

20
00:02:01.635 --> 00:02:09.851
Amy was running out of time. "Oh! Why did I cut my own hair!" she moaned.

21
00:02:09.852 --> 00:02:16.385
Amy ran to her room. She pulled out a colorful scarf and wrapped it around her head.

22
00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:22.931
Now she looked like a fortune-teller. Amy pulled out a box from her closet.

23
00:02:22.932 --> 00:02:25.887
She took out a hat with a large feather.

24
00:02:25.888 --> 00:02:31.584
Now she looked like her grandmother. Amy pulled out another hat.

25
00:02:31.585 --> 00:02:38.069
She put it on and ran out of the house.

26
00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:43.583
"Hi, Amy! Why are you wearing that hat?" asked Lisa.

27
00:02:43.584 --> 00:02:50.526
"Oh, I . . . I felt cold . . . " lied Amy.

28
00:02:50.527 --> 00:02:55.552
"Then why are you wearing shorts?" asked Sherry.

29
00:02:55.553 --> 00:03:00.700
"Hey, the movie's going to start!" said Amy.

30
00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:06.733
"If you're hot, Amy, you should take your hat off," whispered Sherry.

31
00:03:06.734 --> 00:03:13.836
"I'm fine!" Amy whispered back.

32
00:03:13.837 --> 00:03:18.910
"Hey, your hat is blocking my view," said a boy.

33
00:03:18.911 --> 00:03:22.818
"Would you mind taking it off please?"

34
00:03:22.819 --> 00:03:32.301
Amy didn't want her friends to see her haircut, but she had no choice. She slowly took the hat off.

35
00:03:32.302 --> 00:03:37.058
"Whew!" Amy sat back in her seat, relieved.

36
00:03:37.059 --> 00:03:44.984
Since the theater was so dark, no one could see her hair.

37
00:03:44.985 --> 00:03:49.350
"Let's go get some ice cream," said Lisa.

38
00:03:49.351 --> 00:03:53.478
"Will you please take that hat off?" asked Sherry.

39
00:03:53.479 --> 00:03:57.289
Amy pulled her hat tighter over her head.

40
00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:01.857
"The last one to the ice-cream shop is a rotten egg!"

41
00:04:01.858 --> 00:04:07.237
Lisa and Sherry shrugged their shoulders and ran after Amy.

42
00:04:07.238 --> 00:04:13.465
"Hello, girls! Lovely day, isn't it?" called out Mrs. James.

43
00:04:13.466 --> 00:04:20.695
"Hello, Mrs. James! Hello, Oscar!" Oscar was so happy to see the girls.

44
00:04:20.696 --> 00:04:24.347
The girls bent down to pet him.

45
00:04:24.348 --> 00:04:32.773
Oscar began to sniff Amy's hat. "No, Oscar, good doggie. Stop it, Oscar!"

46
00:04:32.774 --> 00:04:40.021
Amy dropped her ice cream. "Oh, my ice cream!" cried Amy.

47
00:04:40.022 --> 00:04:44.070
Oscar pulled the hat right off Amy's head and ran off.

48
00:04:44.071 --> 00:04:51.110
Amy put her hands on her head and tried to cover her hair.

49
00:04:51.111 --> 00:04:57.241
"Amy! Your hair!" screamed Lisa and Sherry.

50
00:04:57.242 --> 00:05:02.370
Amy slowly lowered her hands. It was too late!

51
00:05:02.371 --> 00:05:10.338
Her friends saw her haircut. "What happened?" asked Lisa.

52
00:05:10.339 --> 00:05:18.294
"I wanted to cut my own hair . . . " Amy began.

53
00:05:18.295 --> 00:05:24.327
Amy realized how funny she must have looked wearing the winter hat in the middle of summer.

54
00:05:24.328 --> 00:05:30.653
Suddenly the three girls burst out laughing. They laughed and laughed.

55
00:05:30.654 --> 00:05:40.770
"Okay, but what am I going to do? My hair looks terrible!" said Amy.

56
00:05:40.771 --> 00:05:48.360
"I have an idea," said Sherry. She took out two pins from her hair.

57
00:05:48.361 --> 00:05:51.756
"There. How does that look?"

58
00:05:51.757 --> 00:05:58.870
"Oh, you look cute! I kind of like your haircut!" said Lisa.

59
00:05:58.871 --> 00:06:09.842
Amy looked in a mirror. "Oh, I do look kind of cute!" said Amy. The three girls laughed again.

60
00:06:09.843 --> 00:06:13.793
"Did you have a good time?" asked Mother.

61
00:06:13.794 --> 00:06:16.871
"Yes, we had fun."

62
00:06:16.872 --> 00:06:27.208
"Good. Oh, Amy, I noticed your hair was getting long. I think you need a haircut."

